WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.505 --> 00:00:02.095
- To what do I owe the pleasure,

00:00:02.095 --> 00:00:04.002
you old sandbagging son of a bitch?

00:00:04.002 --> 00:00:05.056
How are you doing?

00:00:05.056 --> 00:00:06.681
Oh my god.

00:00:06.681 --> 00:00:08.388
50 stitches, he's gonna look like

00:00:08.388 --> 00:00:09.595
a Bond villain.
- Hey!

00:00:09.595 --> 00:00:11.134
Shut up!

00:00:18.152 --> 00:00:18.927
- Hey guys.

00:00:18.927 --> 00:00:20.114
- Hey.

00:00:20.114 --> 00:00:21.240
New haircut?

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:22.610
- Yeah.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:23.701
- Looks nice.

00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:24.950
- Thank you.

00:00:29.077 --> 00:00:30.697
- It'll grow out.

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:33.044
(laughing)

00:00:33.044 --> 00:00:33.834
- Oh my god.

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:37.465
This is so funny, oh my god.
(laughing)

00:00:37.465 --> 00:00:39.090
- I don't care what you're laughing at.

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:41.343
Stop trying to get me to ask you.

00:00:41.343 --> 00:00:43.172
- It's so funny.
- No.

00:00:46.765 --> 00:00:48.387
- Sorry guys, I'm in a rush right now.

00:00:48.387 --> 00:00:49.305
- What, what, hey.

00:00:49.305 --> 00:00:50.767
Get to the back of the line, man.

00:00:50.767 --> 00:00:51.585
- Alright, look buddy.

00:00:51.585 --> 00:00:53.352
I got a meeting in three minutes, alright.

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:55.381
- We all have the same meeting.

00:00:55.381 --> 00:00:56.818
Get to the back.

00:01:01.316 --> 00:01:02.524
- Sorry, traffic.

00:01:02.524 --> 00:01:04.573
- We were getting coffee.

00:01:05.275 --> 00:01:06.274
- Things were going really well,

00:01:06.274 --> 00:01:08.329
but she hasn't text me
for like three days.

00:01:08.329 --> 00:01:09.827
- Well maybe she's been busy?

00:01:09.827 --> 00:01:11.452
- She's not into you, man.

00:01:11.452 --> 00:01:13.534
You gotta move on.

00:01:13.534 --> 00:01:14.370
- Do you think you two will have

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:15.752
the project done by tomorrow?

00:01:15.752 --> 00:01:16.820
- Absolutely not.
- Yeah.

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:17.923
- No.
- Definitely.

00:01:17.923 --> 00:01:18.962
- No.

00:01:19.629 --> 00:01:21.255
- Hey Devon, did you
get my Facebook invite?

00:01:21.255 --> 00:01:22.741
- Yeah.
- You coming?

00:01:22.741 --> 00:01:24.834
- No, not a chance.

00:01:26.663 --> 00:01:27.547
- We're going to Loud Bar,

00:01:27.547 --> 00:01:29.335
kind of like a pick me up for Garrett.

00:01:29.335 --> 00:01:31.390
- That bar's awful and so expensive,

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.138
such a long line.

00:01:40.272 --> 00:01:42.443
Let's go to Wavy Dance, better atmosphere.

00:01:42.443 --> 00:01:44.614
I'll buy a round, you know.

00:01:45.525 --> 00:01:47.238
Garrett's at least.

00:01:49.739 --> 00:01:50.656
- What's your drink?

00:01:50.656 --> 00:01:51.864
- [Garrett] Frozen margarita.

00:01:51.864 --> 00:01:53.954
- Yeah, I'mma get you an old fashioned.

00:01:53.954 --> 00:01:55.074
- [Garrett] Okay.

